# 13. What performance optimizations did you implement in Spring Boot?

> **"In my project, we implemented several performance optimizations to improve application response time and scalability. We optimized database queries by using pagination, proper indexing, and fetching only the required columns instead of entire entities. We also used caching for frequently accessed reference data, reducing repeated database calls. Java Streams were used for efficient in-memory data processing, and `CompletableFuture` was implemented to execute multiple external API calls asynchronously. We also configured HikariCP for efficient database connection pooling and used SLF4J logging carefully to avoid excessive logging in production. These optimizations significantly reduced response time, improved throughput, and enhanced the overall performance of the application."**

